<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:800;color:#e6f7f1">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:#9fb0c8">Therapist — practical, evidence-aware practice</div>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Overview</a>
        <a href="specialties.html">Modalities</a>
        <a href="approach.html">How I Work</a>
        <a href="faq.html">Questions</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <h1>My clinical approach</h1>
        <p class="sub">I prioritize clear assessment, collaborative goal-setting, and iterative checks on progress. The aim is to reduce uncertainty while honoring your experience.</p>
      </section>

      <div class="flow">
        <div>
          <div class="card">
            <div style="font-weight:700;color:#e6f7f1">Core elements</div>
            <div class="steps" style="margin-top:12px">
              <div class="step"><div class="dot">A</div><div><strong>Assessment</strong><div class="small">Establishing a shared map of the situation and what counts as improvement.</div></div></div>
              <div class="step"><div class="dot">B</div><div><strong>Strategy</strong><div class="small">Selecting focused interventions tailored to your goals and resources.</div></div></div>
              <div class="step"><div class="dot">C</div><div><strong>Practice</strong><div class="small">Real-world experiments, skills rehearsal, and concrete homework where appropriate.</div></div></div>
              <div class="step"><div class="dot">D</div><div><strong>Review</strong><div class="small">Regular checkpoints to confirm what’s working and revise the plan.</div></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card conf">
            <div style="font-weight:700;color:#e6f7f1">Session boundaries & confidentiality</div>

            <div class="acc-item">
              <button data-target="c1">Confidentiality</button>
              <div class="body" id="c1">I maintain confidentiality in accordance with professional standards. Required exceptions to confidentiality will be explained during intake.</div>
            </div>

            <div class="acc-item">
              <button data-target="c2">Communication outside sessions</button>
              <div class="body" id="c2">I keep outside-session contact limited to scheduling and brief clarifications. For clinical questions, we use sessions to preserve treatment effectiveness.</div>
            </div>

            <div class="acc-item">
              <button data-target="c3">When care needs change</button>
              <div class="body" id="c3">If your needs require a different level of support, I will assist with referrals and transition planning.</div>
