            <div style="font-weight:700;color:#e6f7f1">Next steps</div>
            <div class="small" style="margin-top:8px">If this framework aligns with what you want, we can schedule an initial intake to map priorities and timing.</div>
            <div class="cta" style="margin-top:10px"><a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>
